{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121588","id":4095427804,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70G0Tc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121588","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121588.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121588.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121588","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121588/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121588/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121588/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/76fd2407356818c44393db15a54401c6c458ccf0","number":121588,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `RichTextLabel` nesting with `[font_size][p]`","user":{"login":"kian-g","id":75186370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTg2Mzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75186370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g","html_url":"https://github.com/kian-g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes a RichTextLabel BBCode regression introduced after 4.6 where nesting `[p]` inside `[font_size]` adds an unwanted empty first line.\r\n\r\nRepro:\r\n- Correct: `[p][font_size=22]aaa[/font_size][/p]`\r\n- Broken before this fix: `[font_size=22][p]aaa[/p][/font_size]`\r\n\r\nRoot cause:\r\n- `ITEM_FONT_SIZE` was not treated as formatting-only in layout-subitem detection.\r\n- When `[font_size]` appeared before `[p]`, paragraph insertion logic treated it as prior layout content and split to a new line.\r\n\r\nFix:\r\n- Treat `ITEM_FONT_SIZE` as formatting-only in `_find_layout_subitem()` so paragraph insertion does not create a leading blank line in this nesting case.\r\n\r\nRegression coverage:\r\n- Added a unit test that checks both tag orders produce one line and one paragraph, with no empty first line.\r\n\r\n- Closes #120933","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith